aims).\", \"The oracle L grid range and stride, which determine whether 'ACF equals grid-best' is a fair test.\", \"Total runtime/compute budget and number of seeds/repeats - absent from the brief and not inferable.\", \"Whether dependency installation and dataset download are permitted on the eventual execution machine.\", \"Whether the error-vs-L curve is sharp or flat per dataset; if flat, 'optimal cycle length' may be only weakly identifiable, which would itself be a finding rather than a failure.\"]}", "kind": "ActionEvent"}
